help-intro = Shagoff Commander is a two-panel file manager for COSMIC that works like Total Commander: the same layout and the same keys.
help-rules = Two panels side by side: one is active, Tab switches. The cursor and the marks are separate: Insert or Space marks files, and F5, F6, F8 and the other operations work on the marked files, or on the file under the cursor when nothing is marked. F5 and F6 copy and move into the other panel.
